      "textHash": "095524a381d4a8de28701f2b51949e6fbe6d2479024abfe5c472d306229ad65b",
      "judgment": "A small practical instruction exposes fear and attachment without turning his surrender into absolution.",
      "excerpt": false,
      "sourceAuthor": "Farkur"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-39",
      "article": "papirak",
      "speaker": "Papirak the Strange",
      "groupId": "quotes-everyday",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1261156305251598472",
      "date": "2024-07-12",
      "textHash": "29d39cb2289ef0509800507f432e28ef3c333d7c39f138ae566befc1d5de39d3",
      "judgment": "The boast and request for help preserve his comic timing, damaged memory and real expertise together.",
      "excerpt": false,
      "sourceAuthor": "Papirak the Strange"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-40",
      "article": "coralyn",
      "speaker": "Coralyn",
      "groupId": "quotes-identity",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1322365121636601968",
      "date": "2024-12-28",
      "textHash": "072e3c740b730a3163d1232864027af897a3fcb8debe153e10672e08b20a9869",
      "judgment": "A distinctive introduction joins an unfamiliar social world, practical experience and the cost of learning; its merit does not depend on polished eloquence.",
      "excerpt": false,
      "sourceAuthor": "Coralyn"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-41",
      "article": "akarian",
      "speaker": "Akarian Irenhour",
      "groupId": "quotes-loss",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1362205727992582144",
      "date": "2025-04-16",
      "textHash": "36af222cb72000389b481dd6b979891426cddb86613c6200b36bd2096afa2b02",
      "judgment": "The choice makes loss specific through a remembered relationship, while the scene retains disagreement about what is missing.",
      "excerpt": false,
      "sourceAuthor": "Akarian Irenhour"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-42",
      "article": "saray",
      "speaker": "Saray",
      "groupId": "quotes-history",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1530416591240565018",
      "date": "2026-07-25",
      "textHash": "51e67c537708debb5723365ff49679fb47106c9b1271697cbcd45cd2a1543e28",
      "judgment": "She gives the campaign’s recovery a concrete purpose beyond defeating enemies; her wording and the immediate cost at Hope matter.",
      "excerpt": false,
      "sourceAuthor": "Saray"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-43",
      "article": "minerva",
      "speaker": "Minerva",
      "groupId": "quotes-choice",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1464334033856233683",
      "date": "2026-01-23",
      "textHash": "9cbbf81bfaa7c5e589c9a498c3830f3b44499946b97f32f369f801e6d127e73e",
      "judgment": "The objection captures her resistance to command without making her consistently noble or erasing Ghilsen’s own response.",
      "excerpt": false,
      "sourceAuthor": "Minerva"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-44",
      "article": "ale-chemy-knights",
      "speaker": "Gregory Greenleaf",
      "groupId": "quotes-faith",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1464402500663902425",
      "date": "2026-01-23",
      "textHash": "516a9ae1bfac2db00b3a83c2ff8e71506dea322def3f699b565fc173057072f9",
      "judgment": "His expansive claim to act for everyone’s good makes his paternalism audible; it is not an editorial endorsement.",
      "excerpt": false,
      "sourceAuthor": "Gregory Greenleaf"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-45",
      "article": "brianna",
      "speaker": "Brianna",
      "groupId": "quotes-choice",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1371705996027891723",
      "date": "2025-05-13",
      "textHash": "81cf1a8a595876f1226941d565311de373b42e74fc3ae880a70a982757ab0b90",
      "judgment": "The plea gains weight from an actual quarrel over mercy; it does not manufacture agreement or a healed party.",
      "excerpt": false,
      "sourceAuthor": "Brianna"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-46",
      "article": "wren",
      "speaker": "Wren",
      "groupId": "quotes-power",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1404664075736322161",
      "date": "2025-08-12",
      "textHash": "188964bd2ecb291db6bbcb065fd98d6b00a746b753ac993f69cdf30eede9902b",
      "judgment": "Her modest answer matters inside a conversation about reputation and cultural expectations, rather than as a generic maxim.",
      "excerpt": false,
      "sourceAuthor": "Wren"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-47",
      "article": "aerrow",
      "speaker": "Aerrow",
      "groupId": "quotes-care",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1432942320050769951",
      "date": "2025-10-29",
      "textHash": "485fbb53947fbe7d97c6894ccf210937f7a173c255602ef8bf0793c5f271c94d",
      "judgment": "The blunt division of responsibility conveys his forceful manner and an unfinished rescue, without recasting him as a gentle moralist.",
      "excerpt": false,
      "sourceAuthor": "Aerrow"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-48",
      "article": "tobias",
      "speaker": "Tobias Goodbarrel",
      "groupId": "quotes-everyday",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1322366037886242819",
      "date": "2024-12-28",
      "textHash": "5386ddd8878bcffdd549d98e4dd9f2a43a2838813f19dd06a6c7dfcb955bac57",
      "judgment": "Enthusiasm for tasting gives the cooperative’s practical work a convivial voice; the line earns its place through character and scene, not profundity.",
      "excerpt": false,
      "sourceAuthor": "Tobias Goodbarrel"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-49",
      "article": "camilla",
      "speaker": "Camilla Blackwood",
      "groupId": "quotes-power",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1378529735268892713",
      "date": "2025-06-01",
      "textHash": "dfaa9f255de8c9010064b52cf6daf3e894e42224c224c4bf210c66c729894c1a",
      "judgment": "A short declaration exposes her instinct to organize through command and institutional authority.",
      "excerpt": true,
      "sourceAuthor": "Camilla"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-50",
      "article": "herb",
      "speaker": "Herb Shepard",
      "groupId": "quotes-everyday",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1233970180233887874",
      "date": "2024-04-28",
      "textHash": "f18b1b194266697f6e92dee501441befef477dfd7c636102d337bb870e2ccfe3",
      "judgment": "His dry hospitality under danger sounds like a barkeeper joining a crisis, and supplies humor without a detached stock joke.",
      "excerpt": false,
      "sourceAuthor": "Herb"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-51",
      "article": "st-anky",
      "speaker": "St. Anky",
      "groupId": "quotes-care",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1477727978669736004/1487733229732630538",
      "date": "2026-03-29",
      "textHash": "71bf2e53192f0c6a28d013a5482d8d41dd72c7dc11b0678f251b8cd4498d5823",
      "judgment": "His dialect and stubborn loyalty make the unfinished investigation personal; the line does not validate every theory in his report.",
      "excerpt": true,
      "sourceAuthor": "St. Anky"
    },
    {
      "quoteId": "memorable-quote-52",
      "article": "ryvyt",
      "speaker": "Ryvyt",
      "groupId": "quotes-choice",
      "source": "https://discord.com/channels/1177270231513694249/1199083630354501673/1464337046880391208",
