      "textHash": "5a0bd0ad66b2288ed9312535094e0ffd5b373a1a58b247fa47497cd21274965b",
      "judgment": "The terse contingency gives his companions permission to stop him if the risk turns against them, rather than claiming certainty or invulnerability.",
